# ==============================================================================
# UDAP .NET v2 — C# analiz süiti
#
# İki kaynaktan beslenir:
#   1. Bu paketteki 35 özel sorgu (tasarım kalıpları, SonarQube temiz kod, senior mühendislik).
#   2. codeql/csharp-queries paketindeki standart güvenlik sorguları; kural kataloğundaki
#      R-INJ-*, R-SEC-008 ve R-NET-084 bu sorgulara bağlıdır (bkz. .agents/rules_registry.yaml).
#
# Süitteki her sorgu kataloğa bağlı olmalıdır; `bash .agents/verify.sh` bunu doğrular.
# ==============================================================================
- description: UDAP .NET v2 — Senior Quality, SonarQube, Design Patterns ve güvenlik süiti

# 1) Bu paketin tüm özel sorguları
- queries: .
  from: company-security/csharp-quality-queries

# 2) Katalogda atıf yapılan standart CodeQL güvenlik sorguları
- queries: .
  from: codeql/csharp-queries
- include:
    id:
      - cs/sql-injection                              # R-INJ-001
      - cs/command-line-injection                     # R-INJ-002
      - cs/path-injection                             # R-INJ-003
      - cs/request-forgery                            # R-INJ-004
      - cs/ldap-injection                             # R-INJ-007
      - cs/log-forging                                # R-NET-084
      - cs/information-exposure-through-exception     # R-SEC-008
- include:
    tags:
      - design-patterns
      - maintainability
      - reliability
      - security
      - concurrency
      - performance
